00:08:36.565 --> 00:08:39.134
TIME THEY WANT.

00:08:38.033 --> 00:08:41.604
BUT NOT DURING THE SCHOOL DAY

00:08:39.268 --> 00:08:42.805
WHEN OTHER KIDS MIGHT NOT AGREE

00:08:41.737 --> 00:08:45.207
WITH THE AGENDA.

00:08:42.938 --> 00:08:48.210
&gt;&gt; SO DO YOU THINK THE PEOPLE

00:08:45.341 --> 00:08:49.411
THAT WORKED AT WOOLWORTHS LOOKED

00:08:48.344 --> 00:08:52.248
IT WHEN WHITE CHILDREN SAT IN

00:08:49.545 --> 00:08:53.916
AND SAT ON THE LUNCH COUNTER --

00:08:52.381 --> 00:08:54.817
&gt;&gt; Laura: THAT IS NOT A RELEVANT

00:08:54.049 --> 00:08:56.118
ISSUE AT ALL.

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:58.153
WE'RE OUT OF TIME.

00:08:56.252 --> 00:09:00.923
I GET YOUR POINT.

00:08:58.287 --> 00:09:02.124
I CELEBRATE POLITICAL ACTIVISM.

00:09:01.056 --> 00:09:04.226
I THINK IT'S AWESOME.

00:09:02.258 --> 00:09:06.095
I THINK A LOT OF KIDS WERE

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:06.395
EXCITED AND THEY THINK -- I GET

00:09:06.228 --> 00:09:07.663
THAT.

00:09:06.529 --> 00:09:10.199
WE'RE TALKING ABOUT --

00:09:07.796 --> 00:09:10.866
&gt;&gt; THAT'S NOT HOW YOU'RE

00:09:10.332 --> 00:09:12.434
PRESENTING IT.

00:09:12.568 --> 00:09:15.004
&gt;&gt; Laura: NO, NO.

00:09:13.636 --> 00:09:18.674
JITU, IT'S A POLITICAL ISSUE.

00:09:15.137 --> 00:09:19.842
IT'S BEING PUSHED BY POLITICAL

00:09:18.807 --> 00:09:21.277
GROUPS THAT HAVE AN AGENDA.

00:09:19.975 --> 00:09:22.711
DEMOCRAT POLITICIANS THAT WANT

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.079
TO DRIVE TURNOUT.

00:09:22.845 --> 00:09:25.981
THAT'S MY POINT.

00:09:24.213 --> 00:09:27.082
NOT ALL POLITICAL ACTIVISM.

00:09:26.115 --> 00:09:28.083
THIS IS A SCHOOL DAY.

00:09:27.216 --> 00:09:29.785
KIDS HAVE TO LEARN.

00:09:28.217 --> 00:09:30.052
A LOT OF KIDS DON'T AGREE WITH

00:09:29.919 --> 00:09:31.887
IT.

00:09:30.185 --> 00:09:33.689
THAT'S INTOLLERANT TO MAKE ALL

00:09:32.021 --> 00:09:36.959
KIDS FEEL LIKE THEY HAVE TO TAKE

00:09:33.822 --> 00:09:38.360
PART IN THIS OR THEY'RE NOT --

00:09:37.092 --> 00:09:41.297
&gt;&gt; I KNOW YOUNG PEOPLE IN

00:09:38.494 --> 00:09:42.498
CHICAGO THAT DID NOT WALK OUT.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:45.568
NOBODY PRESSURED THEM.

00:09:42.631 --> 00:09:46.669
NOBODY CRITICIZED THEM.

00:09:45.701 --> 00:09:48.437
&gt;&gt; Laura: IF IT WERE A

00:09:46.802 --> 00:09:50.172
CONSERVATIVE ISSUE BEING PUSHED,

00:09:48.571 --> 00:09:52.541
A LOT OF PEOPLE WOULD CLAIM THEY

00:09:50.306 --> 00:09:55.077
WERE EXCLUDED AND THEY FELT LIKE

00:09:52.675 --> 00:09:55.477
IT WAS AN INTOLLERANT

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:57.413
ATMOSPHERE.

00:09:55.611 --> 00:09:57.813
THAT'S WHY SCHOOLS CAN'T BECOME

00:09:57.546 --> 00:09:59.281
POLITICAL.

00:09:57.947 --> 00:10:00.716
PEOPLE DISAGREE ON THESE ISSUES.

00:09:59.415 --> 00:10:01.083
THEY'RE CONSTITUTIONAL LAWS

00:10:00.849 --> 00:10:01.550
INVOLVED.

00:10:01.216 --> 00:10:03.085
I WAS 12.

00:10:01.684 --> 00:10:04.219
I DIDN'T KNOW THAT MUCH ABOUT

00:10:03.218 --> 00:10:06.188
CONSTITUTIONAL LAW, BUT MAYBE A

